"Instructor Rel-art'h teaches the knight students of the Mother Planet."
"She has long purple-black hair held back with jeweled clips, dark eyes and a magical whisper."
"She sends away students who show weakness at a knight release, such as crying."
"The knight Iella-inwer once mentored her at the art'h house."
"She spent a winter teaching young Stuart the art'h supply library."
"Rel teaches at the Rapport school and directs newling squads on missions."
